  strip_tac >>
  `t = 0 \/ t = 1 \/ t = 2 \/ t = 3 \/ t = 4 \/ t = 5 \/
   t = 6 \/ t = 7 \/ t = 8 \/ t = 9 \/ t = 10 \/ t = 11 \/ t = 12` by decide_tac >>
  fs[]
